later and then my plan is to stand at the main gate and talk to anybody who wants to talk to me and when i tell journalists in hong kong about my plan they say that's different that's not really how we usually do things in china that's um it's really a bad idea that's really a bad idea but i don't know what else to do i have been trying to do things the right way i've been and working with a fixer for the BBC.
