it'd be so great if somebody who uses all this crap we make every day all day long it'd be so great if one of those people came and asked us what was going on because we would have stories for them and i'm just ad-hocing questions i'm asking the questions you would expect what village in china are you from how long have you been working at foxconn what do you do at the plant How do you find your job?
