If they can't do it, there are people behind them watching them, and there are cameras watching both sets of people, and people watching the cameras, they lock it down they sharpen it to a fine sharp edge every hour and those hours are long the official work day in china is eight hours long that's a joke i never met anyone who'd even heard of an eight-hour shift everyone i talked to worked 12-hour shifts standard and often much much longer than that.
一天工作14个小时，一天工作15个小时。

