they look younger than that and I say to them how do you know who's right to work with you how do you how do you find people to help you organize and this sort of breaks the narrative and for a moment they look their age and they look at each other bashfully and they say well we talk a lot we talk all the time we have lots of meetings and we meet at coffee houses and different Starbucks in Guangzhou, and we exchange papers, and sometimes there are books, and it's so clear in this moment that they are making this up as they go along.
